3. Ditto TalkingHead
====================

AI Professor Lite integrates Ditto TalkingHead:

Repository:
https://github.com/antgroup/ditto-talkinghead

Project:
https://digital-avatar.github.io/ai/Ditto/

Model:
https://huggingface.co/digital-avatar/ditto-talkinghead

The Ditto TalkingHead source code, models, checkpoints, and related
components remain subject to the licenses, notices, and usage terms
specified by the original Ditto authors and upstream repositories.

The inclusion or integration of Ditto TalkingHead in this repository does
not transfer ownership of Ditto TalkingHead to the AI Professor Lite
project and does not replace or override the upstream license.


